=You are deciding whether one person is worth contacting, for someone selling to:
{{ $('Who you are looking for').item.json.customer }}

Name: {{ $json.fullName }}
Headline: {{ $json.headline }}
Company: {{ $json.currentCompany || 'unknown' }}
Location: {{ $json.location || 'unknown' }}
About: {{ ($json.snippet || '').toString().slice(0, 1500) }}

Return ONLY valid JSON, no code fence, with these keys:
"score": 1 to 5, where 5 means they clearly match the customer description above.
"reason": one sentence quoting the part of the profile that decided it.
"opener": a single first line referencing something specific on this profile. If the profile has nothing specific in it, return exactly "nothing specific to reference" - do not invent a compliment.
"risk": anything suggesting they are the wrong contact, e.g. they just left, or the title is not the buyer.
